<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n53796" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταγλωττ-ίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bill, kiss wantonly by joining mouths and tongues,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Com.Adesp.
				882
			</span></i>: hence, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέλος κατεγλωττισμένον</span>
			<i>wanton, lascivious</i> song, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Th.</u>
				131
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>use the tongue against</i> another, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψευδῆ κ. τινός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Ach.</u>
					380
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. τινά</span>
			<i>talk</i> one <i>down</i>, hence in 
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόλιν ὑπὸ σοῦ κατεγλωττισμένην σιωπᾶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Eq.</u>
					352
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b> (
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γλῶσσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11.2
				</span></i>
			) in pf.
			part.
			
				Pass.
			, <i>composed of far-fetched words</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λέξις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>VA</u>
					1.17
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Eun.
				<u>VS</u>
				p.496.25D.
			</span></i></div>
